  {
   "id": "cn",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 788,
   "width": 955,
   "height": 32,
   "strokeColor": "#b91c1c",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100096,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700672,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Without the fence, that commit OVERWRITES the new owner's progress - rewinding it (reprocessing) or fast-forwarding it\n(message loss). The zombie would also keep processing messages it no longer owns, duplicating the new owner's work.",
   "originalText": "Without the fence, that commit OVERWRITES the new owner's progress - rewinding it (reprocessing) or fast-forwarding it\n(message loss). The zombie would also keep processing messages it no longer owns, duplicating the new owner's work.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "cn2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 836,
   "width": 394,
   "height": 18,
   "strokeColor": "#b45309",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100097,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700679,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The stop-the-world flaw worth volunteering",
   "originalText": "The stop-the-world flaw worth volunteering",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "cn2b",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 862,
   "width": 1019,
   "height": 81,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100098,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700686,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "During a rebalance EVERY member stops consuming, even those whose assignment does not change. A 100-consumer group stalls\nentirely because one consumer restarted - and 98 of them then get the identical assignment back. During a rolling deploy you\npay it 100 times. Fixes: STICKY assignment (removes the wasted work), INCREMENTAL COOPERATIVE rebalancing (removes the stall -\nmembers revoke only what they lose), and STATIC MEMBERSHIP (a consumer returning with the same member ID inside the session\ntimeout triggers no rebalance at all, turning a 100-rebalance deploy into zero).",
   "originalText": "During a rebalance EVERY member stops consuming, even those whose assignment does not change. A 100-consumer group stalls\nentirely because one consumer restarted - and 98 of them then get the identical assignment back. During a rolling deploy you\npay it 100 times. Fixes: STICKY assignment (removes the wasted work), INCREMENTAL COOPERATIVE rebalancing (removes the stall -\nmembers revoke only what they lose), and STATIC MEMBERSHIP (a consumer returning with the same member ID inside the session\ntimeout triggers no rebalance at all, turning a 100-rebalance deploy into zero).",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  }
